+This repository stays independently runnable. The platform wraps the original `model.py` through its adapter - it does not replace, patch or fork this code.
+
+## Run it inside the platform
+
+```bash
+pip install "git+https://github.com/rajaram-2005/wt-pm-lstm-scada-anomaly.git#subdirectory=platform"
+wt-pm fetch-models --dir ./external      # clone this repo and its siblings
+export WTPM_EXTERNAL_DIR=$PWD/external   # adapters import external/<repo>/model.py
+wt-pm inspect                            # m25-tinyml-safety should report available
+wt-pm serve --port 8100                  # HTTP API + command centre
 ```
 
